#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions return the smallest integral value that is not less than "
"I<x>."
msgstr ""
"Funkcje te zwracają najmniejszą wartość całkowitą nie mniejszą od I<x>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For example, I<ceil(0.5)> is 1.0, and I<ceil(-0.5)> is 0.0."
msgstr "Na przykład I<ceil(0.5)> zwraca 1.0, a I<ceil(-0.5)> zwraca -0.0."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
